.TH pgloupe-stats 1  "stats " 
.SH NAME
pgloupe\-stats \- Work with `pg_stat_statements` snapshots
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpgloupe stats\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Work with `pg_stat_statements` snapshots
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
pgloupe\-stats\-diff(1)
Compare two snapshot CSV exports and rank the queries that changed
.TP
pgloupe\-stats\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
